            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A cosa servono i confronti con <code>!=</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Per eseguire il codice quando due valori sono diversi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Per eseguire il codice quando due valori sono uguali</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Per eseguire sempre il blocco di codice dell'istruzione if</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Non eseguire mai il blocco di codice dell'istruzione if</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Per eseguire il codice quando due valori sono diversi.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 81506,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi un'istruzione if che utilizzi il confronto <code>&gt;</code> per eseguire il codice se <code>score</code> è maggiore di un numero.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"score = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;new highest score!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;37&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"new highest score!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>if</code>, seguito da <code>score</code> e poi <code>&gt;</code>, <code>50</code>, <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 3",
            "id": 81507,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nella prima condizione, verifica se <code>grade</code> non è uguale a <code>\"A\"</code>. Nella seconda condizione, verifica se <code>subject</code> è uguale a <code>\"Math\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"subject = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Math&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"grade = \" /><text value=\"&quot;A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" grade != \" /><text value=\"&quot;A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Give \" /><text value=\"{subject}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" a chance&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" subject == \" /><text value=\"&quot;Math&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Today's a great day for solving equations!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;grade&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;subject&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Today's a great day for solving equations!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>grade</code>, seguito da <code>!=</code> e poi <code>\"A\"</code>, <code>subject</code>, <code>==</code>, <code>\"Math\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
